// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/pointing.h>

#define Base        0
#define Nav         1
#define SpaceNav    2
#define Num         3
#define Sym         4
#define Func        5
#define MouseNav    6
#define Game        7
#define GamePlus    8

&mt {
    flavor = "balanced";
    tapping-term-ms = <200>;
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
};

&lt {
    flavor = "balanced";
    quick-tap-ms = <150>;
};

/ {
    behaviors {
        hm: homerow_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        dot_colon: dot_colon {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = ". :";
            bindings = <&kp PERIOD>, <&kp COLON>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        comma_semi: comma_semi {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = ", :";
            bindings = <&kp COMMA>, <&kp SEMI>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        combo_bootloader {
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <500>;
            key-positions = <0 9>;
            layers = <Func>;
            bindings = <&bootloader>;
        };

        combo_caps_word {
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            key-positions = <13 16>;
            bindings = <&caps_word>;
        };

        combo_game {
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <500>;
            key-positions = <32 37>;
            bindings = <&tog Game>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        Base {
            display-name = "Base";
            bindings = <
            &kp Q  &kp W  &kp E             &kp R        &mt RALT T            &mt RIGHT_ALT Y  &kp U       &kp I            &kp O       &kp P
            &kp A  &kp S  &kp D             &kp F        &kp G                 &kp H            &kp J       &kp K            &kp L       &kp SEMI
&kp LSHIFT  &kp Z  &kp X  &kp C             &kp V        &mt LWIN B            &mt LWIN N       &kp M       &kp COMMA        &kp PERIOD  &kp SLASH  &kp LCTRL
                          &mt LEFT_ALT ESC  &lt Nav TAB  &lt MouseNav SPACE    &lt Sym ENTER    &lt 4 BSPC  &lt Func DELETE
            >;
        };

        Nav {
            display-name = "Nav";
            bindings = <
       &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp NUMBER_4  &kp N5    &kp NUMBER_6    &kp N7          &kp NUMBER_8  &kp NUMBER_9  &kp NUMBER_0
       &trans        &trans        &trans        &trans        &trans    &kp LEFT_ARROW  &kp DOWN_ARROW  &kp UP_ARROW  &kp RIGHT     &none
&none  &trans        &trans        &trans        &trans        &trans    &kp PAGE_UP     &kp PAGE_DOWN   &kp COMMA     &kp PERIOD    &none         &none
                                   &trans        &trans        &trans    &kp HOME        &trans          &kp END
            >;
        };

        SpaceNav {
            display-name = "Spaces";
            bindings = <
       &none           &kp LA(NUMBER_1)  &kp LA(NUMBER_2)  &kp LA(NUMBER_3)  &none        &none   &none               &kp LA(UP_ARROW)    &none                &none
       &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp LA(NUMBER_4)  &kp LA(NUMBER_5)  &kp LA(NUMBER_6)  &kp LA(F)    &none   &kp LA(LEFT_ARROW)  &kp LA(DOWN_ARROW)  &kp LA(RIGHT_ARROW)  &none
&none  &none           &kp LA(N7)        &kp LA(N8)        &kp LA(N9)        &kp LA(V)    &none   &none               &none               &none                &none  &none
                                         &trans            &trans            &trans       &trans  &trans              &trans
            >;
        };

        Num {
            display-name = "Num";
            bindings = <
       &kp PIPE  &kp N1  &kp N2     &kp N3  &kp STAR     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
       &kp FSLH  &kp N4  &kp N5     &kp N6  &kp EQUAL    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&none  &kp BSLH  &kp N7  &kp N8     &kp N9  &kp MINUS    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                         &kp COMMA  &kp N0  &kp DOT      &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        Sym {
            display-name = "Sym";
            bindings = <
           &kp EXCLAMATION  &kp AT     &kp HASH   &kp DOLLAR  &kp PRCNT    &kp CARET  &kp AMPS   &kp STAR          &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS
           &kp POUND        &kp CARET  &kp DLLR   &kp LPAR    &kp RPAR     &kp MINUS  &kp EQUAL  &kp SINGLE_QUOTE  &kp LEFT_BRACKET      &kp RIGHT_BRACKET
&kp LSHFT  &kp QMARK        &kp EXCL   &kp GRAVE  &kp LBKT    &kp RBKT     &kp GRAVE  &kp NUHS   &kp NON_US_BSLH   &trans                &kp BACKSLASH          &trans
                                       &kp LT     &kp UNDER   &kp GT       &trans     &trans     &trans
            >;
        };

        Func {
            display-name = "Func";
            bindings = <
                &kp F10  &kp F1  &kp F2  &kp F3  &none     &trans  &kp C_VOLUME_DOWN  &kp C_VOLUME_UP  &kp K_MUTE  &trans
                &kp F11  &kp F4  &kp F5  &kp F6  &none     &trans  &trans             &trans           &trans      &trans
&studio_unlock  &kp F12  &kp F7  &kp F8  &kp F9  &none     &trans  &trans             &trans           &trans      &trans  &trans
                                 &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans             &trans
            >;
        };

        MouseNav {
            display-name = "Mouse";
            bindings = <
        &none           &none      &none      &none      &none        &trans          &trans          &trans        &trans           &trans
        &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp LC(X)  &kp LC(C)  &kp LC(V)  &kp LC(Z)    &mmv MOVE_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_UP  &mmv MOVE_RIGHT  &trans
&trans  &mkp MB4        &mkp MB5   &mkp MB3   &mkp MB2   &mkp MB1     &msc SCRL_LEFT  &msc SCRL_UP    &msc SCRL_UP  &msc SCRL_RIGHT  &trans  &trans
                                   &trans     &trans     &trans       &mkp RCLK       &mkp LCLK       &mkp MCLK
            >;
        };

        Game {
            display-name = "Game";
            bindings = <
       &kp TAB     &kp Q  &kp W    &kp E      &kp R           &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
       &kp LSHIFT  &kp A  &kp S    &kp D      &kp F           &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
&none  &kp LCTRL   &kp Z  &kp X    &kp C      &kp V           &none  &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
                          &kp ESC  &kp SPACE  &sl GamePlus    &none  &none  &none
            >;
        };

        GamePlus {
            display-name = "Game+";
            bindings = <
       &kp I  &kp N1  &kp N2  &kp N3  &kp T     &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
       &kp K  &kp N4  &kp N5  &kp N6  &kp B     &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
&none  &kp M  &kp N7  &kp N8  &kp N9  &kp J     &none  &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
                      &trans  &kp N0  &trans    &none  &none  &none
            >;
        };
    };
};
